					"content": "But Dadda, he really is a good guy, and he tells great stowies!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						200291902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lily"
				},
				{
					"id": 200291902,
